{"id":"657520","name":"鸭肉花菜饭","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657520/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花菜","amount":"300g"},{"name":"鸭胸脯肉","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米辣","amount":"3个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"花菜用清水浸泡。","img":"images/657520/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入锅中煮开。","img":"images/657520/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮到变色变软。","img":"images/657520/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出花菜。","img":"images/657520/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切碎。","img":"images/657520/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小米辣切碎。","img":"images/657520/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用煮花菜的水煮鸭胸脯肉煮熟。","img":"images/657520/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捞出切成小丁。","img":"images/657520/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"把所有食材和调料放入大盆中抓拌均匀。","img":"images/657520/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"充分入味。","img":"images/657520/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"即可食用。","img":"images/657520/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}